<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Investors Title started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Investors Title started.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hilliard Lyons analyst John Roberts said he started coverage of Investors Title Co with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the title insurance concern closed Tuesday at 15-3/4.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The company has shown an excellent track record of growth,&quot; Roberts said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
